    "updated_at": "2022-06-07T07:46:51Z",
    "body": "Interesting idea... The big question with clipboard is what to actually put on the clipboard. The async clipboard API doesn't currently support files (though we're hoping to change that at some point) and I don't believe that includes plans to put directories on the clipboard. I'll link this issue in our [tracking bug](https://crbug.com/1099775) so this stays on our radar once clipboard files support is added.\r\n\r\nRegardless, this use case should be satisfied soon anyways, since we're hoping to allow [`move()`](https://github.com/whatwg/fs/pull/10) to support moving files and directories from the sandboxed file system to a folder of the user's choice.",
