    "updated_at": "2022-06-13T14:03:53Z",
    "body": "🤔 just thinking to myself if i get access to a user directory or file that a person already have on their file system from this new `showOpenFilePicker`, `showDirectoryPicker` (aka not from the sandboxed filesystem - OPFS) would it then be safe to copy them to clipboard?",
